    <item>
      <title>Aggiorna un sito Hugo esistente a Blowfish 3</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/guides/202608-upgrade-to-blowfish-v3/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/guides/202608-upgrade-to-blowfish-v3/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;lead text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 !mb-9 text-xl&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Blowfish 3 è retrocompatibile. I siti esistenti possono essere aggiornati senza riscrivere la configurazione o i contenuti.&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Prima dell&amp;rsquo;aggiornamento&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;prima-dellaggiornamento&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#prima-dellaggiornamento&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ancora&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Esegui il commit del sito attuale e assicurati che la versione di Hugo rientri nell&amp;rsquo;intervallo dichiarato da Blowfish. Se hai file personalizzati nella directory del tema, spostali prima nelle directory &lt;code&gt;assets/&lt;/code&gt; o &lt;code&gt;layouts/&lt;/code&gt; del sito, così gli aggiornamenti non li sovrascriveranno.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/guides/202608-upgrade-to-blowfish-v3/featured.png" />
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Build your homepage using Blowfish and Hugo</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/it/guides/202310-blowfish-tutorial/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Oct 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/it/guides/202310-blowfish-tutorial/</guid>
      <description>Just one year ago, I created Blowfish, a Hugo theme crafted to build my unique vision for my personal homepage. I also decided to make it an open-source project. Fast-forward to today, and Blowfish has transformed into a thriving open-source project with over 600 stars on GitHub and a user base of hundreds. In this tutorial, I’ll show you how to get started and have your website running in a couple of minutes.</description>
      <media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/guides/202310-blowfish-tutorial/featured.jpg" />
